OL,3,ATributes paid to 'inspirational'
OL,4,Apresenter and campaigner Esther Rantzen
OL,5,
OL,6,FDame Esther Rantzen was "an
OL,7,Finspirational individual" who was
OL,8,F"quite a force" as a campaigner,
OL,9,Faccording to the director of Childline,
OL,10,Fthe children's helpline founded by the
OL,11,Fbroadcaster in the 1980s.
OL,13,F"She inspired people, she energised
OL,14,Fpeople, she persuaded people," Shaun
OL,15,FFriel told BBC Breakfast. "She had a
OL,16,Fgreat mind and she had obviously that
OL,17,Fnatural journalistic ability."
